  "body": "`cargo test -p xtask` fails on upstream/main `93fe3cfd0` (M5 main-health; last green `1db03daa6`):\n\n`gate_maps_tests::no_gate_map_names_a_moved_module_as_app` (xtask/src/gate_maps_tests.rs:126): `suites without a Gate map: [\"wcs_rotation_control\"]`.\n\n`crates/app/tests/wcs_rotation_control.rs` came in with merge `16d62df1e` (PR #2136, #760) and has no `Gate map` line in its header. The suite covers app::commands, app::operation (generate), app::posting and app::stock_sim under a Z-rotated WCS (check the imports when writing the line; do not name moved modules such as app::verify or app::post as app::<module>).\n\nEach PR passed its own gate; the law runs only in `cargo test -p xtask`. Same class as #2307.\n\nDone means: `cargo test -p xtask` is green on main.\n",
